James was troubleshooting an issue with a Shiny app where an action button, defined with `hidden(actionButton("saveButton", "Save Investuration"))`, was not initially hidden on the page. I provided a detailed checklist to help him identify the problem: ensuring the `shinyjs` package was included with `useShinyjs()`, checking for JavaScript conflicts, verifying browser settings, and using developer tools to inspect if the button had the proper CSS style applied. I also suggested creating a minimal reproducible example to help isolate the issue if the problem persisted.
